{"5082120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Misfortuna", "steam_appid": 5082120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spin</strong>. <strong>Win</strong>. <strong>Buy </strong>absurd upgrades. Win bigger. Watch the numbers grow <strong>ENORMOUS</strong>, and most importantly, make sure the mafia gets its cut... <i>or else.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/1b6ec040edac885f7722e22146356414.poster.avif?t=1787951201\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/1b6ec040edac885f7722e22146356414.webm?t=1787951201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/1b6ec040edac885f7722e22146356414.mp4?t=1787951201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misfortuna </strong>is an <strong>incremental roulette </strong>game, where the your father owed the mafia a fortune <i>(way too much money)</i>, then disappeared... leaving you to pay for his sins at the roulette table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist today to get notified on  cool stuff going on!  And join our <strong>Discord</strong> to actively be a part of shaping the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/c362422f482926b78c2a16d1f0c0c61c.poster.avif?t=1787951201\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/c362422f482926b78c2a16d1f0c0c61c.webm?t=1787951201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/c362422f482926b78c2a16d1f0c0c61c.mp4?t=1787951201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the <strong>Misfortuna </strong>you can</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin a roulette wheel (and eventually other wheels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as the numbers <strong>grow exponentially larger!</strong> (Bigger number = Better)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades that can</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your payout by a <strong>LOT</strong>, (where &quot;a LOT&quot; is a severe understatement.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiply</strong> the balls! It's easier to win with more balls in the game, so why not get 1, 2, 3, or maybe 50 extra?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the <strong>type</strong> of balls you use, sticking with a normal ball is boring anyways!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>streaks</strong>! Everyone loves streaks, and they pay even more money!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain <strong>powerups</strong>! What they do you'll have to find out, together they might help you make enough money to finally pay back the <strong>mafia</strong>! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Way more to come, help us shape the game with new upgrades, general improvements, and feedback by <strong>joining our Discord!</strong></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe one day pay back all your family debt...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/432a56c2e2e9a8c4183b1783a4d00ceb.poster.avif?t=1787951201\" width=560 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/432a56c2e2e9a8c4183b1783a4d00ceb.webm?t=1787951201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/432a56c2e2e9a8c4183b1783a4d00ceb.mp4?t=1787951201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features coming to the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prestige system with meta progression, to make new runs even crazier! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different &quot;Stages&quot; where the player progress to new environments and unlock new upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story told by more awesome comics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more and crazier visuals and VFX!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More and new wheels to spin!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Way more upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More original soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More customization of the roulette wheel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automation!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ABSOLUTELY NO GENERATIVE AI is used in the creation of this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you</strong> for giving our game a chance! &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The BitHydra Studio Team</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spin</strong>. <strong>Win</strong>. <strong>Buy </strong>absurd upgrades. Win bigger. Watch the numbers grow <strong>ENORMOUS</strong>, and most importantly, make sure the mafia gets its cut... <i>or else.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/1b6ec040edac885f7722e22146356414.poster.avif?t=1787951201\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/1b6ec040edac885f7722e22146356414.webm?t=1787951201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/1b6ec040edac885f7722e22146356414.mp4?t=1787951201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misfortuna </strong>is an <strong>incremental roulette </strong>game, where the your father owed the mafia a fortune <i>(way too much money)</i>, then disappeared... leaving you to pay for his sins at the roulette table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist today to get notified on  cool stuff going on!  And join our <strong>Discord</strong> to actively be a part of shaping the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/c362422f482926b78c2a16d1f0c0c61c.poster.avif?t=1787951201\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/c362422f482926b78c2a16d1f0c0c61c.webm?t=1787951201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/c362422f482926b78c2a16d1f0c0c61c.mp4?t=1787951201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the <strong>Misfortuna </strong>you can</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin a roulette wheel (and eventually other wheels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as the numbers <strong>grow exponentially larger!</strong> (Bigger number = Better)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades that can</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your payout by a <strong>LOT</strong>, (where &quot;a LOT&quot; is a severe understatement.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiply</strong> the balls! It's easier to win with more balls in the game, so why not get 1, 2, 3, or maybe 50 extra?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the <strong>type</strong> of balls you use, sticking with a normal ball is boring anyways!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>streaks</strong>! Everyone loves streaks, and they pay even more money!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain <strong>powerups</strong>! What they do you'll have to find out, together they might help you make enough money to finally pay back the <strong>mafia</strong>! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Way more to come, help us shape the game with new upgrades, general improvements, and feedback by <strong>joining our Discord!</strong></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe one day pay back all your family debt...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/432a56c2e2e9a8c4183b1783a4d00ceb.poster.avif?t=1787951201\" width=560 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/432a56c2e2e9a8c4183b1783a4d00ceb.webm?t=1787951201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/extras/432a56c2e2e9a8c4183b1783a4d00ceb.mp4?t=1787951201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features coming to the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prestige system with meta progression, to make new runs even crazier! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different &quot;Stages&quot; where the player progress to new environments and unlock new upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story told by more awesome comics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more and crazier visuals and VFX!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More and new wheels to spin!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Way more upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More original soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More customization of the roulette wheel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automation!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ABSOLUTELY NO GENERATIVE AI is used in the creation of this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you</strong> for giving our game a chance! &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The BitHydra Studio Team</p>", "short_description": "Misfortuna is a satisfying incremental roulette game. Spin a roulette wheel, stack absurd upgrades, multiply your balls, and watch payouts spiral from pocket change to numbers that barely fit on the screen! In Misfortuna every spin is a chance to break the game even further in your favor!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/6a92d1d362e63886311e234541e6dbfdef35b640/header.jpg?t=1787951201", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/6833bafc683fbb64a417f59fee4d64518056cbfb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787951201", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/6833bafc683fbb64a417f59fee4d64518056cbfb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787951201", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 4th generation or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Most dedicated GPUs should be fine.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["BitHydra Studio"], "publishers": ["BitHydra Studio"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 80, "description": "#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/4fb42c587f7495173580c2d6565355baec9930d8/ss_4fb42c587f7495173580c2d6565355baec9930d8.600x338.jpg?t=1787951201", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/4fb42c587f7495173580c2d6565355baec9930d8/ss_4fb42c587f7495173580c2d6565355baec9930d8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787951201"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/5a390d6c1f4f268c77bdf8ce236d64fc44b57dd2/ss_5a390d6c1f4f268c77bdf8ce236d64fc44b57dd2.600x338.jpg?t=1787951201", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/5a390d6c1f4f268c77bdf8ce236d64fc44b57dd2/ss_5a390d6c1f4f268c77bdf8ce236d64fc44b57dd2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787951201"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/7848af95be5b07ede3b35d2be182e04d2da7a72c/ss_7848af95be5b07ede3b35d2be182e04d2da7a72c.600x338.jpg?t=1787951201", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082120/7848af95be5b07ede3b35d2be182e04d2da7a72c/ss_7848af95be5b07ede3b35d2be182e04d2d